member.returns:
true when this caller now owns the key and should do the work;
false when it was already claimed — in which case the existing
record's LastSeenAtUtc is updated so a repeat is observable.

member.summary:
PR correction — the caller's role alone decides Assign authority now;
there is no more self-claim path. CS Agent and Department Employee
hold no assignment capability at all (see TicketRoleSets' remarks).
